<header class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-inner">
    <h1>Ways to Give</h1>
    <p class="lede">Everyone gets involved — give whatever you like. However you choose to take part, your gift funds the teachers, science labs, arts, and student support that make SIES special. {{ site.taxLine }}</p>
  </div>
  {% include "partials/wave-sand.njk" %}
</header>

<section class="give-option card-has-img" aria-labelledby="give-to-grow">
  <div>
    <h2 id="give-to-grow">Give to Grow: our year-round campaign</h2>
    <p>The simplest way to give, any time of year. Our goal is 100% school participation: every family, at whatever level feels right. Families who donate receive SIES stickers, and every gift goes straight to work in classrooms.</p>
    <p class="todo-placeholder"><strong>Online giving link coming soon.</strong> Until then, email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> to give today.</p>
  </div>
  <img class="card-img" src="/assets/images/garden-harvest.jpg" alt="Students show off radishes harvested from the school garden" loading="lazy">
</section>

<section class="give-option card-has-img" aria-labelledby="fun-run">
  <div>
    <h2 id="fun-run">Soar on Skimmers Fun Run</h2>
    <p>Every fall, all students participate in a school-day fun run, collecting pledges through personal fundraising links shared with family and friends. Registration runs through RunSignUp.</p>
    <p class="todo-placeholder"><strong>Registration link coming soon.</strong></p>
  </div>
  <img class="card-img" src="/assets/images/fun-run-beach.jpg" alt="Students run along the sand during the Soar on Skimmers Fun Run" loading="lazy">
</section>

<section class="give-option" aria-labelledby="auction">
  <h2 id="auction">Spring Auction</h2>
  <p>Our largest single fundraiser — an online silent auction with in-person gatherings each spring. Bid, donate an item, become a sponsor, or <a href="#volunteer">volunteer</a>.</p>
  <p class="todo-placeholder"><strong>Auction site link coming soon.</strong> To donate an item or sponsor, email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
</section>

<section class="give-option" aria-labelledby="directory">
  <h2 id="directory">Directory &amp; Signs — business sponsorship</h2>
  <p>Local businesses sponsor placement in the school directory and on school-fence banner signage. Fully tax-deductible, and seen by the whole school community. <a href="/for-businesses/">Learn more for businesses →</a></p>
</section>

<section class="give-option" aria-labelledby="direct">
  <h2 id="direct">Family &amp; corporate gifts, any time</h2>
  <p>Direct gifts from families and businesses are welcome all year. Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> and we'll make it easy.</p>
</section>

<section class="give-option" aria-labelledby="volunteer">
  <h2 id="volunteer">Volunteer your time</h2>
  <p>Not every gift is a donation — FRIENDS runs on volunteers, and there's a role for everyone.</p>
  <h3>Spring Auction</h3>
  <p>Join the planning committee for the Spring Silent Auction. Opportunities range from collecting auction items to planning the event itself. FRIENDS has a role for everyone to help get involved and raise funds for SIES.</p>
  <h3>Soar on Skimmers Fun Run</h3>
  <p>True to its name, the Fun Run is an enjoyable event for everyone. You can get involved as a race-day volunteer or by committing a bit more time to join the committee.</p>
  <h3>General interest</h3>
  <p>If you want to get involved with FRIENDS but don't see a specific event above, we still need your help. We need support throughout the year and are always looking for volunteers.</p>
  <form class="volunteer-form" action="/api/volunteer" method="post">
    <p class="form-error" id="volunteer-error" hidden>Something went wrong sending your form. Please try again — or email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> and tell us how you'd like to help.</p>
    <label for="vol-name">Name</label>
    <input type="text" id="vol-name" name="name" required autocomplete="name" maxlength="200">
    <label for="vol-email">Email address</label>
    <input type="email" id="vol-email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" maxlength="200">
    <fieldset>
      <legend>I'd like to help with</legend>
      <label class="check-row"><input type="checkbox" name="interest" value="Spring Auction"> Spring Auction</label>
      <label class="check-row"><input type="checkbox" name="interest" value="Fun Run"> Soar on Skimmers Fun Run</label>
      <label class="check-row"><input type="checkbox" name="interest" value="General interest"> Wherever I'm needed</label>
    </fieldset>
    <label for="vol-message">Anything you'd like us to know? <span class="optional">(optional)</span></label>
    <textarea id="vol-message" name="message" rows="4" maxlength="2000"></textarea>
    <p class="hp-field" aria-hidden="true"><label for="vol-website">Leave this field empty</label><input type="text" id="vol-website" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></p>
    <div class="cf-turnstile" data-sitekey="0x4AAAAAAD4IngtXV5b_7Fp1"></div>
    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Sign up to volunteer</button>
  </form>
  <p>Prefer email? Reach us at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
  <script src="https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js" async defer></script>
  <script>
    if (new URLSearchParams(location.search).has("form")) {
      document.getElementById("volunteer-error").hidden = false;
    }
  </script>
</section>

<section class="band band-sea closing-cta">
  <svg class="band-wave" viewBox="0 0 1440 70" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M0,45 C240,15 480,60 720,35 C960,10 1200,55 1440,30 L1440,0 L0,0 Z" fill="#fdfaf5"></path></svg>
  <div class="band-inner">
    <h2 class="section-title">Ready to give today?</h2>
    <p>Everyone gets involved. Give whatever you like.</p>
    <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Email us to give</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
